The login/logout control disappeared because your custom template overrides the `userlinks` block in `rest_framework/base.html`. By default, this block contains the authentication links.

To preserve the login/logout control while adding your own content, you must use `{{ block.super }}` within the `userlinks` block in your `api.html` file. This ensures that the default authentication links are included alongside your additions.

Example:
```html
{% block userlinks %}
    {{ block.super }}
    <li><a href="...">My Custom Link</a></li>
{% endblock %}
```

